      "statement": "Applications are organized by namespace under kubernetes/apps/ with kube-system for cluster services (Cilium, CoreDNS, metrics-server), flux-system for Flux infrastructure, network for networking services (Cloudflare Tunnel, Tailscale, AdGuard DNS), observability for monitoring stack (Grafana, Prometheus, Loki), storage for storage infrastructure (TopoLVM, VolSync), default for user applications (~30 apps), cert-manager for certificate management, database for database operators, external-secrets for secret management, and external-server for external-facing applications.",
