    {
      "id": "claim_131ada83ae7542999a171fb9492cc430",
      "statement": "The cluster uses dual-layer secret management: SOPS + age for Git encryption (talos configs use whole-file encryption, Kubernetes configs encrypt only data/stringData fields per .sops.yaml rules, Flux decrypts using sops-age secret) and External Secrets Operator with Bitwarden for runtime secrets (ClusterSecretStore connects to Bitwarden Connect, ExternalSecret CRs define which secrets to sync, secrets never stored in Git).",
